# Frontend

## App Router

- Pages: `frontend/src/app/` — `/`, `/browse`, `/story/[slug]`, `/blindspot`, `/bias`, `/rumors`, `/pro`, `/sign-in`, `/sign-up`, `/offline`, **`/admin`**, **`/admin/login`** (internal; `admin/layout.tsx` sets `robots: noindex`)
- Layout: `layout.tsx` wires `ThemeProvider`, `SiteHeader`, `MobileNav`, `InstallPWA`; fonts Inter + Newsreader + Noto Sans Bengali
- Shared UI: `frontend/src/components/`
- Domain helpers: `frontend/src/lib/` (`api`, `stories`, `demo-data`, `perspectives`, `coverage`, **`subscription-plans`**, **`subscription-features`**, **`subscription-access`**, **`database.types`**, `supabase`, **`admin-api`**, **`admin-auth`**, **`admin-types`**)
- Route handlers: `frontend/src/app/api/admin/` — `login`, `logout`, `ingest` (server-only; never call backend admin/ingest from the browser with secrets)
- `frontend/src/middleware.ts` — cookie gate for `/admin/*` except `/admin/login`

## Data fetching

- Server components for listings and story pages; use `getTopStories`, `fetchClusters`, etc. from `lib/`
- Home feed uses **`FREE_DAILY_TOP_STORIES_LIMIT`** (10) from `subscription-features.ts` via `getTopStories`
- Graceful degradation: catch API errors and empty states (see home page demo banner when `fromApi` is false)
- Client components for interactive UI (meters, tabs, modals, mobile nav, PWA install, theme toggle)

## Admin ops (internal)

- Set **`ADMIN_PASSWORD`** in `.env.local` (server-only) to enable login; optional **`ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET`** (defaults to password for signed cookie `jachai_admin`)
- **`ADMIN_API_KEY`** must match backend when set — used server-side in `admin-api.ts` as `X-Admin-Key` for `/admin/overview`
- **`INGEST_API_KEY`** (server-only) forwarded as `X-Ingest-Key` when triggering ingest from `AdminIngestPanel` via `POST /api/admin/ingest`
- Prefer extending `admin-api.ts` / `admin-types.ts` for new ops endpoints; keep credentials out of client bundles

## Auth, Pro & gating

- Supabase client: `lib/supabase.ts` — typed with `Database` from `database.types.ts`; only active when `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` and `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` are set
- Sign-in / sign-up pages under `/sign-in`, `/sign-up`
- **Free vs Pro matrix**: `lib/subscription-features.ts` (`SUBSCRIPTION_FEATURE_MATRIX`, `PRO_ONLY_FEATURE_IDS`, `featureRequiresPro`, `getFeatureRow`)
- **Entitlement check**: `lib/subscription-access.ts` — `hasProAccess()` reads `NEXT_PUBLIC_MOCK_PRO` until Supabase subscription status is wired
- **Browse** (`/browse`): server gate via `hasProAccess()`; free users see `BrowseProGate` + `PaywallModal`; Pro/mock-Pro loads full cluster/article browse
- **Pro marketing**: `/pro` uses `FeatureMatrixTable`, plan cards from `subscription-plans.ts`, checkout still stubbed (`PaywallModal`)
- Pricing/constants: `subscription-plans.ts`; bKash env vars documented in `frontend/.env.example` (server-only when integrated)

## PWA

- `@ducanh2912/next-pwa` in `next.config.ts` (wrapped with `withSentryConfig`); service worker and install prompt in **production** builds only
- Offline shell: `/offline`; `InstallPWA` in root layout
- Generated PWA assets under `frontend/public/` (e.g. `sw.js`) — do not hand-edit; rebuild after PWA config changes

## Error monitoring (optional)

- `@sentry/nextjs` — `instrumentation.ts` loads `sentry.server.config` / `sentry.edge.config`; browser SDK in `instrumentation-client.ts` at `frontend/` root
- Env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE`; CI map upload via `SENTRY_ORG`, `SENTRY_PROJECT`, `SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN` (see `frontend/.env.example`)
- Omit DSN locally — Sentry stays disabled with no runtime cost

## Types

- API shapes: exported from `lib/api.ts`
- Rich story UI: `Story`, `NewsSource` from `lib/demo-data.ts`
- Supabase: `lib/database.types.ts` — align with `supabase/migrations/`
- Do not duplicate types across components; import from `lib/`

## UI notes

- Light/dark via `next-themes` (`ThemeProvider`, `ThemeToggle`); zinc palette, `font-display` for headings
- Keep BN strings alongside EN where the product already does
- Product components: `StoryFeedCard`, `HeadlineClashCard`, `HeadlineCompare`, `BiasMeter`, `RumorBadge`, `PerspectiveComparison`, `CoverageBar`, `SourceFilterList`, `StoryTabs`, **`BrowseProGate`**, **`FeatureMatrixTable`**, `PaywallModal`, **`AdminIngestPanel`**, **`AdminLogoutButton`**
